OL,3,GNEWSAPriest pleads guilty to 109 sex
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA priest has pleaded guilty to 109 sex
OL,7,Foffences at Londonderry Crown Court.
OL,9,FEdward Gallagher, 59, whose address is
OL,10,FMaghaberry Prison, will be sentenced in
OL,11,FDecember.
OL,13,FThe charges relate to dates between 22
OL,14,FJune 2023 and 18 April 2025.
OL,16,FThey include among others attempted
OL,17,Fsexual communication with a child under
OL,18,F16, possessing indecent images of a
OL,19,Fchild, possessing an extreme
OL,20,Fpornographic image and attempting to
OL,21,Fencourage a child to engage in sexual
OL,22,Factivity.
